      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R49/2013-A-SK1-2023.02 Rev. 1\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"project_number\": \"TK-P05-85\",\n    \"page_total\": 12,\n    \"member_state\": \"Slovakia\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2023-05-25\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"Slovak Legal Metrology (SLM)\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\n      \"Hviezdoslavova 1124/31\",\n      \"974 01 Banská Bystrica\",\n      \"Slovakia\"\n    ],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"Peter Vook\",\n    \"person_title\": \"Director\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"UAB Axioma Metering\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\n        \"Veterinaru str. 52, Biruliskes\",\n        \"LT-54469 Kaunas region\",\n        \"Lithuania\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"UAB Axioma Metering\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\n        \"Veterinaru str. 52, Biruliskes\",\n        \"LT-54469 Kaunas region\",\n        \"Lithuania\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Water meter\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\n      \"Qalcosonic W1\"\n    ],\n    \"module_designation\": \"Ultrasonic water meters with electronic indication device\",\n    \"description\": \"Compact ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume of clean water in residential use at metering conditions. Measurement based on the ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle. Non-resettable measurement between two constant partners. Can be installed in horizontal and vertical positions; not designed to measure reverse flow. Non-essential parts: antenna; non-return valve (optional).\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": \"Qalcosonic W1\",\n    \"models\": [\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN25\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN32\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN40\"}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"components\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"Flow sensor\",\n      \"type_designations\": [],\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"body\": \"plastic cylindrical brass body with inlet and outlet firmly connected with the plastic housing for the calculator\",\n        \"sound_path\": \"inner plastic element with two mirrors placed in the cylindrical plastic body\",\n        \"transducers\": \"two ultrasonic transducers placed on the upside of the cylindrical plastic body\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"Calculator and indication device\",\n      \"type_designations\": [],\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"mounting\": \"plastic housing of the calculator with indication device directly mounted on the flow sensor\",\n        \"electronics\": \"three PCB boards and one PCB with calculator\",\n        \"display\": \"electronic LCD display with 2 lines\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {\n      \"measurement_principle\": {\n        \"value\": \"ultrasonic, bidirectional transit-time\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"installation_positions\": {\n        \"value\": \"horizontal and vertical\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"reverse_flow_measurement\": {\n        \"value\": false,\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"display_upper_line_digits\": {\n        \"value\": 9,\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"digits\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"display_upper_line_max_indicated_volume\": {\n        \"value\": 999999.999,\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"display_lower_line_digits\": {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"digits\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"display_lower_line_quantity\": {\n        \"value\": \"current flow rate\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"m³/h\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"battery_life\": {\n        \"value\": 16,\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"years\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      },\n      \"battery_type\": {\n        \"value\": \"non-replaceable lithium\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      }\n    },\n    \"model_level\": [\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"battery_configuration\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"model\": \"DN15\", \"value\": \"two internal 'AA' size batteries (option: two 'AA' size batteries + one 'A23')\"},\n          {\"model\": \"DN20\", \"value\": \"two internal 'AA' size batteries (option: two 'AA' size batteries + one 'A23')\"},\n          {\"model\": \"DN25\", \"value\": \"two internal 'AA' size batteries (option: two 'AA' size batteries + one 'A23')\"},\n          {\"model\": \"DN32\", \"value\": \"two internal 'AA' size batteries (option: two 'AA' size batteries + one 'A23')\"},\n          {\"model\": \"DN40\", \"value\": \"one internal 'D' size battery (option: one 'D' size battery + one 'A23')\"}\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"id\": \"R49\",\n    \"edition\": 2013,\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"accuracy_classes\": [\"2\"]\n  },\n  \"test_reports\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2022/ER010/SK1\",\n      \"date\": \"2023-01-13\",\n      \"pages\": 17,\n      \"role\": \"type_evaluation_report\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Technical documentation file AXIOMA_Qalcosonic W1_00\",\n      \"date\": \"2023-01-13\",\n      \"pages\": 114,\n      \"role\": \"documentation_file\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"revision_history\": [\n    {\n      \"revision\": \"0\",\n      \"date\": \"2023-01-13\",\n      \"changes\": \"Certificate first issued\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"revision\": \"1\",\n      \"date\": \"2023-05-25\",\n      \"changes\": \"Point 2.4 Software specification – supplemented specification for all DNs separately\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
